---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 24
---
flowchart TB
    accTitle: Sharing the archive with your household
    accDescr: Every run writes the documents of the household from Paperless-ngx into the folder Archive of the target user. The target user shares the folder Archive itself, which the path template doesn't change, with the group of the household in Nextcloud, View only, so that each member finds the documents in Files on the web, with the desktop client and in the Nextcloud app on the phone. The folder Inbox is shared with those who may send documents, with the permission to edit, so that they scan or save into it, and the next run sends the files to Paperless. Someone without an account, such as a tax adviser, gets a share link to a folder, View only, with an expiration date and a password. Instead of one shared archive, per-user ownership gives each member an archive of their own, with the documents that they own in Paperless. Paperless-ngx is green, the folders of Nextcloud blue, the people orange and the other way indigo.

    paperless["Paperless-ngx with the<br>documents of the household"]
    archive["📁 Archive of the<br>target user, which<br>the runs write"]
    inbox["📁 Inbox of the<br>target user"]
    family["👪 The household, a group<br>of Nextcloud: Files on the<br>web, the desktop and<br>the phone"]
    adviser["🧾 A tax adviser,<br>without an account"]
    own["Or per-user ownership:<br>each member gets an<br>archive of their own, with<br>the documents that they<br>own in Paperless"]

    paperless -- "every run" --> archive
    archive -- "shared with the<br>group, View only" --> family
    family -- "scan or save into it,<br>shared with permission<br>to edit" --> inbox
    inbox -- "next run" --> paperless
    archive -- "Share link: View only,<br>expiration date<br>and password" --> adviser
    paperless -.-> own

    classDef paperless fill:#17803d2e,stroke:#17803d,stroke-width:2px
    classDef nextcloud fill:#0082c92e,stroke:#0082c9,stroke-width:2px
    classDef yours fill:#f59e0b2e,stroke:#f59e0b,stroke-width:2px
    classDef check fill:#526cfe2e,stroke:#526cfe,stroke-width:2px
    class paperless paperless
    class archive,inbox nextcloud
    class family,adviser yours
    class own check
